  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contract related to: Auditor&#xed;a de verificaci&#xf3;n de gastos para el contrato 2020 / 418062 &#xbf;Instrumento marco de cooperaci&#xf3;n M&#xe9;xico - Uni&#xf3;n Europea para el Desarrollo en Transici&#xf3;n&#xbf; - MX. - The Regional Cooperation Facility 2025 provides support measures for the LAC region as well as for no Latin America MIP countries such as Argentina, Brazil, Chile, Mexico, Panama, Uruguay. It is articulated around one single specific objectives in support to the EU-LAC regional agenda, and particularly its Global Gateway Investment Agenda, with two outputs around respectively technical assistance and policy dialogue/strategic communication.</narrative>
  </description>
